# Docker runs the code in Linux, and bash refuses CRLF ("bash\r: No such file or directory").
# Check out LF everywhere, even on Windows with core.autocrlf=true (PowerShell runs LF scripts fine).
* text=auto eol=lf
# CSVs are written by Python's csv module (CRLF); keep their bytes exactly as committed
*.csv -text
*.xlsx binary
*.db binary
